+    ``TypeVarTuple`` is bound to a tuple of types: ``tuple[int, *Ts, str]`` with
+    ``Ts = (a, b)`` yields ``(int, a, b, str)``. A still-unbound ``*Ts`` is left
+    in place (with its inner re-substituted) so it reads as unresolved."""
